# Whitelist-style ignore: everything is ignored by default and only the files
# tracked in this repo are re-included. This keeps the local results_*/
# outputs_*/ trees and the raw data/ generations (several GB) out of version
# control. Note that a new file needs a matching "!" line below before git will
# see it -- or use `git add -f <path>`.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md

# --- investment experiment ---
!online_cvar_invest_ru.py
!run_20_26_ru.sh
!2020_2026.csv

# --- toxicity experiment ---
!toxicity_scores/
toxicity_scores/*
!toxicity_scores/online_cvar_detoxify_ru.py
!toxicity_scores/run_ru.sh
!toxicity_scores/build_slim_data.py
!toxicity_scores/download_raw_data.sh

# Slim (numeric-only) toxicity data: ~6 MB, enough to reproduce every result.
# The raw generations live on the Hugging Face Hub instead -- see README.
!toxicity_scores/data_slim/
!toxicity_scores/data_slim/llama3.2_real_toxic/
!toxicity_scores/data_slim/llama3.2_real_toxic/*.pkl
